Package: gpsadb
Title: R Client for the 'GPSAdb' Genetic Perturbation Database
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person("Yonghe", "Xia", , "xiayh17@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Query 'GPSAdb', a database of genetic perturbation RNA-seq
    datasets with precomputed differential expression and gene set enrichment,
    and run its signature-matching tools from R. Data is retrieved over the
    database's Model Context Protocol ('MCP') endpoint using the 'aisdk.mcp'
    client, and results are returned as tibbles. Covers dataset search and
    metadata, per-dataset differential expression and 'GSEA', reverse lookups
    across every dataset, and signature search ('BioTrigger', 'fastGPSA').
    Reference: Guo et al. (2026) <doi:10.1093/nar/gkaf1077>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: aisdk.mcp, tibble, utils
Suggests: aisdk, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes: YuLab-SMU/aisdk.mcp
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/gpsadb
BugReports: https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/gpsadb/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
